@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L1：消费中发送子消息的关联上下文传播

participant ProviderConsumer
participant MessageTemplate
participant MessageContextAccessor as Accessor
participant ParentHandler
participant MessageEnvelopeEnricher as Enricher
participant MessageProvider as Provider

ProviderConsumer -> MessageTemplate: inbound parent M1
MessageTemplate -> Accessor: open(CurrentMessage(M1))
MessageTemplate -> ParentHandler: handle(M1)
ParentHandler -> MessageTemplate: send(child M2)
MessageTemplate -> Enricher: enrich(M2)
Enricher -> Accessor: current()
Accessor --> Enricher: M1
Enricher -> Enricher: M2.messageId = new ID
Enricher -> Enricher: M2.correlationId = M1.correlationId
Enricher -> Enricher: M2.causationId = M1.messageId
Enricher -> Enricher: M2.source = current applicationName
Enricher --> MessageTemplate: enriched M2
MessageTemplate -> Provider: send(M2)
Provider --> MessageTemplate: result
MessageTemplate --> ParentHandler: SendResult
ParentHandler --> MessageTemplate: SUCCESS
MessageTemplate -> Accessor: close() / restore parent scope
MessageTemplate --> ProviderConsumer: SUCCESS

note over Enricher
messageKey 不自动继承。
它由业务根据子消息关联的实体显式设置。
end note
@enduml
